---
/* Homepage "Frequently asked questions" section. */
---
<section class="hpSec" id="hpFaq">
  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>Is coPaint free?</h3>
    <p>Yes — completely free, with no accounts and no sign-up.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>Do I need to sign up?</h3>
    <p>No. Just open the app and start drawing.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>Where are my drawings saved?</h3>
    <p>On your own device, inside your browser. Nothing is uploaded to any server.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>Does it work offline?</h3>
    <p>Drawing, saving and exporting work offline. Collaboration rooms need an internet connection.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>How do rooms keep kids safe?</h3>
    <p>Room codes are random 5-letter codes and rooms can be password protected. The creator can pause anyone's drawing or remove anyone from the room at any time.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpFaq">
    <h3>Can I print my drawing?</h3>
    <p>Yes — turn on the A4 guide to see the print area, then save as PNG or PDF and print it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
